4,"user_turn_provenance":[{"character_range":[0,407],"next_role":"assistant","previous_role":null,"raw_text_sha256":"7c4ef74f04158ae86b5fba78fcc0ef83e321705efd72aca4ab8e049508400e56","role":"user","sequence":1},{"character_range":[0,124],"next_role":"assistant","previous_role":"assistant","raw_text_sha256":"a7bb182d8047da5a63f539a5dd8c1f59986372140e35bd374eb6cc96712ecea4","role":"user","sequence":4},{"character_range":[0,110],"next_role":"assistant","previous_role":"assistant","raw_text_sha256":"8a63fbd4976ce82715150776cb71359709cfc6b3f3efb8ba604e4b9c84de9505","role":"user","sequence":7},{"character_range":[0,14],"next_role":"assistant","previous_role":"assistant","raw_text_sha256":"5d65a363d25048250f1af8cb04513462642b7ee78667c28f8ef1c415e92fbb7a","role":"user","sequence":10}]},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:93e5869a2f039e049b1c4564","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/7e2ff92549b6b1600de1228aeebc837e2cb2a021b1e0122909b923782ecd5191.json","sha256":"f2ab311b5b29a367c0d25ae54601e682c6ca616914b35d33a7c2a8e7ab1fde88"}],"text":"[http://127.0.0.1:8765/open/GS-719](http://127.0.0.1:8765/open/GS-719) 这道题我完全无从下手，主要是不清楚在区域内“积分与路径无关”到底意味着什么。\n\n是不是指积分与路径无关就意味着可以用格林公式？还是用什么别的公式去做？比如通过 ∂Q/∂x - ∂P/∂y 转化成一个二重积分去做？\n\n这道题里：\n• P = x / (x² + y² - 1)\n• Q = -ay / (x² + y² - 1)\n\n我觉得直接分别求偏导太难算了，是这么算吗？还是有更简单的方法？\n\n我知道这种曲线积分跟二重积分不一样，如果已知 x² + y² - 1 等于某个常数，我会直接代入到积分里去做。但题目给的是 x² + y² < 1，也就是 x² + y² - 1 < 0。如果分母 x² + y² - 1 = 0 的话岂不是有奇点？\n\n所以这道题到底该怎么做？"},"source:95b7c2458cf0ba27d75c3b68":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["离散条件分布"],"metadata":{},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:95b7c2458cf0ba27d75c3b68","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/wiki/topics/knowledge_clusters/MATHWIKI-KNOWLEDGE-686_离散条件分布.md","sha256":"c7ccdeb5bee5106ff7fe3ec68ce94c128316225a26fe665bea4d7bb8f4aa2fe6"}],"text":"# 离散条件分布\n\n本页是由五份讲义来源提炼的通用知识锚点，不含本人作答证据；关联题只表示知识点归属，不推断错因、掌握度或复习状态。\n\n## 范围\n\n固定一个变量的具体取值，用相应行／列概率除以该条件的边缘概率。\n\n## 条件与边界\n\n分母需正；条件分布的取值对象是未固定的那个变量。\n\n## 来源\n\n| 来源 | 文件 | PDF页 | 书内页 | 定位短语 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| FH-B | 2027考研数学--概率统计就这点事-基础篇--方浩.pdf | 82 | 77 | 条件分布律 |\n| ZY-P | 《2026张宇数学基础30讲 概率论与数理统计分册》.pdf | 77–78 | 65–66 | 条件分布 |\n\n## 上级知识节点\n\n- 条件分布（候选上级，未作为已接受的 is-a 边）\n- 离散型随机变量（候选上级，未作为已接受的 is-a 边）\n\n## 知识关系（提案，未生效）\n\n- prerequisite → PR05.08：建议的学习／调用前置，不是逻辑充分条件；允许其他学习顺序。\n\n## 关联正式题\n\n暂无关联正式题。\n\n## 来源标识\n\n- 参考包运行标识：`A-math-anchor-distribution-20260909-01`\n- 包内定位：`PR05.04`（仅用于本包定位，不是本地正式 ID）\n- 来源范围：`main`；锚点类型：`knowledge`"},"source:994f40972e8032affe6aba77":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["多元函数微分学","多元函数极限","多元函数连续可微","极限与连续"],"metadata":{"coverage":"full_bytes","image_semantic_reviewed":false,"original_path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-370/question_01.png","original_sha256":"f62e0b4d4fe0f6aca61fd5481bf10b4e4f872e011ff072b709c0e69b0645bda5","personal_evidence":false,"role":"reference_only_not_mastery","size":92762,"status":"verified","text_status":"text_unavailable_no_ocr"},"not_proof_of_same_error":true,"record_id":"source:994f40972e8032affe6aba77","source_refs":[{"path":"错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/0d746a995cdf32a871c1cccd070ca3ab7e4f9cd9155896ebfe9afb7916fbeced.json","sha256":"56f00f1e41ab4bbbce1fb7c9138315a074d7631cf03a63d10b72c062dedebdf9"},{"path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-370/question_01.png","sha256":"f62e0b4d4fe0f6aca61fd5481bf10b4e4f872e011ff072b709c0e69b0645bda5"}],"text":""},"source:9a94ca95972c384d29980395":{"association":"learning_material_not_personal_error","formal_id":null,"kind":"general_learning_material","labels":["一元函数积分学的计算","三角形回代","三角恒等变形","三角换元","不定积分","反三角函数积分","反正切型积分","回代化简","对数型积分","整体凑微分","根式换元","第一类换元","第二类换元"],"metadata":{"coverage":"full_bytes","image_semantic_reviewed":false,"original_path":"错题知识网络/assets/visual_wrong_questions/GS-619/question_01.png","original_sh